  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Marine Monitoring Along the Aqaba Coastline</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Marine Monitoring along the Aqaba Coastline: the project aims to contribute to enhancing the existing marine monitoring program that was established more than 25 years ago by Aqaba Special Economic Zone Authority (ASEZA). The project is in line with the national and local polices and strategies that are directing all efforts towards protecting and sustaining natural resources.</narrative>
